│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ shared_multicast_tree                                                                     │
│ patch_description        │ Replace independent per-destination shortest paths with a greedy multicast-tree           │
│                          │ construction. The previous implementation sends every destination along its own source    │
│                          │ path, which can pay repeatedly for common prefixes. This edit grows a shared directed     │
│                          │ broadcast tree: at each step it finds the cheapest remaining destination reachable from   │
│                          │ any node that already receives the data, adds only that incremental branch, and records   │
│                          │ the resulting source-to-node routes.                                                      │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ All partitions use the same shared tree, allowing transfers over common links to be       │
│                          │ broadcast once before branching near destinations. Edges without a usable cost are        │
│                          │ excluded so routing remains valid even when the profile has incomplete cost entries. The  │
│                          │ resulting topology preserves the existing `BroadCastTopology` interface while reducing    │
│                          │ redundant cross-cloud transfer cost.                                                      │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0267                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
│ system_prompt_id         │ None                                                                                      │
