│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ greedy_broadcast_tree                                                                     │
│ patch_description        │ Replace independent shortest-path selection with a shared, incremental broadcast-tree     │
│                          │ construction. The previous implementation finds one path per destination, which           │
│                          │ duplicates expensive source-side transfers whenever several destinations can share an     │
│                          │ upstream route.                                                                           │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The new strategy grows a directed multicast tree from the source. At each step it uses    │
│                          │ multi-source Dijkstra from every node already reached by the tree and connects the        │
│                          │ remaining destination with the lowest additional network cost. Newly added relay nodes    │
│                          │ can then serve subsequent destinations, allowing the topology to reuse paid inter-cloud   │
│                          │ links and branch close to destination regions. Every partition receives the same          │
│                          │ tree-derived route, so partitions may be transferred in parallel on independent tree      │
│                          │ branches while avoiding redundant upstream transfers.                                     │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This is a practical greedy directed-Steiner approximation: it is substantially less       │
│                          │ expensive than independent unicast paths while remaining efficient and compatible with    │
│                          │ BroadCastTopology’s existing per-destination path representation.                         │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
