│ patch_name               │ shared_multicast_tree                                                                     │
│ patch_description        │ Replace independent source-to-destination unicast routing with a greedy shared            │
│                          │ multicast-tree construction. The previous implementation sends every partition for every  │
│                          │ destination over a separate shortest path, charging common source/relay links repeatedly  │
│                          │ in the broadcast topology.                                                                │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The new approach grows a low-cost directed tree from the source. At each step it finds    │
│                          │ the cheapest route from any already-reached relay to any unreached destination, adds that │
│                          │ route once to the shared tree, and treats any additional requested destinations           │
│                          │ encountered along that route as reached as well. Each destination then receives its       │
│                          │ source-to-destination route extracted from the common tree for every partition. This      │
│                          │ preserves partition delivery while maximizing overlapping transfers and allowing low-cost │
│                          │ intermediate cloud relays to fan out data.                                                │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Edges with missing or invalid costs are excluded before routing so Dijkstra does not fail │
│                          │ on incomplete cost profiles. Unreachable destinations retain empty paths rather than      │
│                          │ causing the entire search to fail.                                                        │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
